{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Math Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) x + 2y = 6 এবং x/y = 4 হলে x = ?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) 2", "option4": "ঘ) 4", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x + 2y = 6.......(1)<br />এবং x/y = 4<br />বা, x/y = 4,<br />বা, x = 4y<br />বা, x - 4y = 0.....(2)<br />(1)নং - (2)নং হতে পাই<br />6y = 6<br />&there4; y = 1<br />&there4; (2) নং হতে পাই,<br />x - 4.1 = 0<br />বা, x = 4</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) x/4 + 4 = x/5 + 5 হলে x = ?", "option1": "ক) 10", "option2": "খ) 20", "option3": "গ) 15", "option4": "ঘ) 30", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>x/4 + 4 = x/5 + 5<br />বা, x/4 - x/5 = 5 - 4<br />বা, (5x - 4x)/20 = 1<br />বা, x/20 = 1<br />&there4; x = 20</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) x<sup>2</sup> - (a - b)x - ab = 0 হলে x = ?", "option1": "ক) {a, b}", "option2": "খ) {-a, b}", "option3": "গ) {a, -b}", "option4": "ঘ) {-a, -b}", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x<sup>2</sup> - (a - b)x - ab = 0<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> - ax + bx - ab = 0<br />বা, x(x - a) + b(x - a) = 0<br />বা, (x - a)(x + b) = 0<br />&there4; x = a, -b</p>"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) x - 2y = 5 এবং xy = 3 হলে y = ?", "option1": "ক) {-3, 1/2}", "option2": "খ) {3, 1/2}", "option3": "গ) {-2, 1/3}", "option4": "ঘ) {2, 1/3}", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>এখানে,<br />x - 2y = 5<br />বা, x = 2y + 5<br />আবার,<br />xy = 3<br />বা, (2y + 5)y = 3<br />বা, 2y<sup>2</sup> + 5y - 3 = 0<br />বা, 2y<sup>2</sup> + 6y - y - 3 = 0<br />বা, 2y(y + 3) - 1(y + 3) = 0<br />বা, (y + 3)(2y - 1) = 0<br />হয়,<br />y + 3 = 0<br />&there4; y = -3<br />অথবা,<br />2y - 1 = 0<br />বা, 2y = 1<br />&there4; y = 1/2<br />&there4; y = -3, 1/2</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) &radic;(x + 5) = &radic;2x + &radic;5 হলে x = ?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1", "option3": "গ) 2", "option4": "ঘ) 5", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>x = 0 হলে,<br />বামপক্ষ = ডানপক্ষ হয়<br />&there4; x = 0</p>"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) 3/(x + 1) + 4/(2 - x) = 0 হলে x = ?", "option1": "ক) -10", "option2": "খ) 0", "option3": "গ) 10", "option4": "ঘ) 11", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>3/(x + 1) + 4/(2 - x) = 0<br />বা, 3/(x + 1) = -{4/(2 - x)}<br />6 - 3x = (-4x) - 4<br />বা, 4x - 3x = (-4) - 6<br />&there4; x = -10</p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) a<sup>2</sup>b = 16 এবং ab = 4 হলে b = ?", "option1": "ক) 0", "option2": "খ) 1/2", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) 4", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>এখানে,<br />a<sup>2</sup>b = 16.....(1)<br />ab = 4.........(2)<br />(1) নং &divide; (2) নং থেকে পাই,<br />a<sup>2</sup>b/ab = 16/4<br />বা, a = 4<br />(2) নং থেকে পাই,<br />4.b = 4<br />&there4; b = 1</p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) xy = 9 এবং y/x = 4 হলে x = ?", "option1": "ক) {3/2}", "option2": "খ) {-(3/2)}", "option3": "গ) {-3/2, 3/2}", "option4": "ঘ) {2/3, -(2/3)}", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>xy = 9......(1)<br />y/x = 4......(2)<br />(1) নং &times; (2) নং দ্বারা পাই<br />y<sup>2</sup> = 36<br />y = &plusmn;6<br />(1) নং হতে পাই,<br />x(&plusmn;6) = 9<br />বা, x = &plusmn;9/6<br />= &plusmn;3/2</p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) 3x - 4y = 10 এবং 6x - 8y = 18 হলে (x, y) = ?", "option1": "ক) (0, 0)", "option2": "খ) (3, 0)", "option3": "গ) (0, 4)", "option4": "ঘ) কোনটাই না", "answer": "4", "exp": "কোন সমাধানই উভয় সমীকরনকে সিদ্ধ করেনা।"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) ।2x - 1| < 5 এর সমাধান সেট", "option1": "ক) (-3, -2)", "option2": "খ) (-2, 3)", "option3": "গ) [-2, 3]", "option4": "ঘ) {-2, 3}", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>|2x - 1| &lt; 5<br />বা, -5 &lt; 2x - 1 &lt; 5<br />বা, -5 + 1 &lt; 2x - 1 + 1 &lt; 5 + 1<br />বা, -4 &lt; 2x &lt; 6<br />বা, -2 &lt; x &lt; 3<br />&there4; x = (-2, 3)</p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) x/2 + y/3 = 2 এবং x/3 - y/2 = 1 হলে (x, y) = ?", "option1": "ক) 48/13, -(6/13)", "option2": "খ) 48/13, 6/13", "option3": "গ) 13/48, 13/6", "option4": "ঘ) -(48/13), 6/13", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>প্রদত্ত সমীকরণ,<br />x/2 + y/3 = 2<br />বা, (3x + 2y)/6 = 2<br />&there4; 3x + 2y = 12.......(1)<br />আবার, x/3 - y/2 = 1<br />বা, (2x - 3y)/6 = 1<br />&there4; 